# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates
# (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees.md). .claude/settings.json is
# tracked and registers hooks at $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/scripts/, but the
# scripts themselves are installed by `macf rules refresh` and gitignored
# (#1395), so a fresh worktree would otherwise have none of them.
.claude/scripts/*.sh
